## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Biometric Privacy:** The system keeps all face images and encodings locally. No data is sent to external servers. This project is for educational/micro-project use.
> 
> **Webcam Requirement:** The system requires an active, connected laptop/PC webcam (Device index 0 by default).
> 
> **Tolerance (Threshold):** The default face matching threshold is set to `TOLERANCE = 0.5`. A lower threshold is more strict (fewer false positives, but might miss matching if the angle/lighting changes). A higher threshold is more lenient (more false positives).

